exports[`renderNotificationEmail > renders every content type 1`] = `"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html dir="ltr" lang="en"><head><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://ourworldindata.org/owid-email-header.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://images.ourworldindata.org/ghi/w=1200"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://images.ourworldindata.org/abc/w=1200"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://images.ourworldindata.org/def/w=1200"/><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><title>Your weekly update from Our World in Data</title></head><body style="background-color:#f7f7f7;margin:0;padding:0"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0" data-skip-in-text="true">How close is the world to eradicating guinea worm disease? · Cereal yields have increased in all regions · What has driven deforestation in the 21st c</div><!--body--><table border="0" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" align="center"><tbody><tr><td style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f7f7f7;color:#1d3d63;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px"><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:632px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;background-color:#f7f7f7"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#002147"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://ourworldindata.org" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank"><img alt="Our World in Data Update" height="132" src="https://ourworldindata.org/owid-email-header.png" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;height:auto;background-color:#002147;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-align:center" width="632"/></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:32px 40px 40px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 32px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:32px;margin-left:0">Here is what we published in the last<!-- --> <!-- -->week<!-- --> across the topics you follow.<br/><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/api/email-notifications/request-link?token=user-token" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Update your preferences</a> <!-- -->or, if this was forwarded to you,<!-- --> <a href="https://ourworldindata.org/subscribe" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">subscribe here</a>.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column"><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Data update<!-- --> — <span style="color:#1d3d63">Health</span></p></td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="text-align:right;white-space:nowrap"><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">August 6</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:24px;font-weight:700;color:#1d3d63"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/guinea-worm" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">How close is the world to eradicating guinea worm disease?</a></h2><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Cases have fallen from 3.5 million a year.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Only a handful of cases remain.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">The last cases are the hardest to reach.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:16px 0;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/guinea-worm-cases" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Explore our data on guinea worm<!-- --> →</a></p><img alt="Reported guinea worm cases since 1986" src="https://images.ourworldindata.org/ghi/w=1200" style="display:block;outline:none;border:1px solid #ebeef2;text-decoration:none;width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 0 16px" width="504"/></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="height:32px;line-height:32px;font-size:1px"><tbody><tr><td> </td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column"><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Data Insight<!-- --> — <span style="color:#1d3d63">Food and Agriculture</span></p></td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="text-align:right;white-space:nowrap"><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">August 5</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:24px"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/data-insights/cereal-yields" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank"><img alt="Cereal yields by region" src="https://images.ourworldindata.org/abc/w=1200" style="display:block;outline:none;border:1px solid #ebeef2;text-decoration:none;width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 0 16px" width="504"/></a><h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:24px;font-weight:700;color:#1d3d63"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/data-insights/cereal-yields" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Cereal yields have increased in all regions</a></h2><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Global yields of cereal crops have tripled since <a href="https://ourworldindata.org/crop-yields" style="color:inherit;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">1961</a>.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:16px 0;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/cereal-yields" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Explore this data in our interactive chart<!-- --> →</a></p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:16px 0 0;color:#426591;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">By <!-- -->Hannah Ritchie</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="height:32px;line-height:32px;font-size:1px"><tbody><tr><td> </td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column"><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Article<!-- --> — <span style="color:#1d3d63">Energy and Environment</span></p></td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="text-align:right;white-space:nowrap"><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">August 3</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#ebeef2;padding:16px 16px 24px"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/deforestation-drivers" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank"><img alt="" src="https://images.ourworldindata.org/def/w=1200" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 0 24px" width="520"/></a><h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;color:#1d3d63"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/deforestation-drivers" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">What has driven deforestation in the 21st century?</a></h2><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 8px;font-style:italic;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Hannah Ritchie</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><b>Beef</b> was by far the largest driver of deforestation.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">The second-largest was <a href="https://ourworldindata.org/palm-oil" style="color:inherit;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">oilseeds</a>.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/deforestation-drivers" style="color:#ce261e;text-decoration-line:none;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Read the article<!-- --> →</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="height:32px;line-height:32px;font-size:1px"><tbody><tr><td> </td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column"><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Announcement</p></td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="text-align:right;white-space:nowrap"><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">August 1</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:24px;font-weight:700;color:#1d3d63"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/new-site-search" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">We&#x27;ve rebuilt our site search</a></h2><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Finding a chart should now be faster.</p><ul style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px 24px;padding:0;color:#1d3d63"><li style="margin:0 0 4px">Results are grouped by type.</li><li style="margin:0 0 4px">Filters are remembered.</li></ul><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Results are grouped by content type.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="height:32px;line-height:32px;font-size:1px"><tbody><tr><td> </td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column"><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Topic update<!-- --> — <span style="color:#1d3d63">Malaria</span></p></td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="text-align:right;white-space:nowrap"><p style="font-size:10px;line-height:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">July 31</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:24px;font-weight:700;color:#1d3d63"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/malaria-topic-update" style="color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">We&#x27;ve updated our work on malaria</a></h2><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">The topic page now covers the vaccines.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">We have also refreshed every chart.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:0 40px 40px;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 24px;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:24px;margin-left:0"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/latest" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:none;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background-color:#002147;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Browse the latest on Our World in Data</a></p><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#426591;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">This email was sent to <!-- -->reader@example.com<!-- --> because you subscribed to email updates from Our World in Data.</p><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#426591;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">You can<!-- --> <a href="https://ourworldindata.org/api/email-notifications/request-link?token=user-token" style="color:#426591;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">update your preferences</a> <!-- -->or<!-- --> <a href="https://ourworldindata.org/api/email-notifications/unsubscribe?token=user-token" style="color:#426591;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">unsubscribe</a> <!-- -->at any time.</p><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#426591;text-align:center;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0">Our World in Data · Global Change Data Lab · Oxford, United Kingdom</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"`;

exports[`renderNotificationEmail > renders the plain-text alternative 1`] = `
"https://ourworldindata.org

Here is what we published in the last week across the topics you follow.
Update your preferences https://ourworldindata.org/api/email-notifications/request-link?token=user-token or, if this was forwarded to you, subscribe here https://ourworldindata.org/subscribe.

Data update — Health

August 6


HOW CLOSE IS THE WORLD TO ERADICATING GUINEA WORM DISEASE? https://ourworldindata.org/guinea-worm

Cases have fallen from 3.5 million a year.

Only a handful of cases remain.

The last cases are the hardest to reach.

Explore our data on guinea worm → https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/guinea-worm-cases

 

Data Insight — Food and Agriculture

August 5

https://ourworldindata.org/data-insights/cereal-yields


CEREAL YIELDS HAVE INCREASED IN ALL REGIONS https://ourworldindata.org/data-insights/cereal-yields

Global yields of cereal crops have tripled since 1961 https://ourworldindata.org/crop-yields.

Explore this data in our interactive chart → https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/cereal-yields

By Hannah Ritchie

 

Article — Energy and Environment

August 3

https://ourworldindata.org/deforestation-drivers


WHAT HAS DRIVEN DEFORESTATION IN THE 21ST CENTURY? https://ourworldindata.org/deforestation-drivers

Hannah Ritchie

Beef was by far the largest driver of deforestation.

The second-largest was oilseeds https://ourworldindata.org/palm-oil.

Read the article → https://ourworldindata.org/deforestation-drivers

 

Announcement

August 1


WE'VE REBUILT OUR SITE SEARCH https://ourworldindata.org/new-site-search

Finding a chart should now be faster.

 * Results are grouped by type.
 * Filters are remembered.

Results are grouped by content type.

 

Topic update — Malaria

July 31


WE'VE UPDATED OUR WORK ON MALARIA https://ourworldindata.org/malaria-topic-update

The topic page now covers the vaccines.

We have also refreshed every chart.

Browse the latest on Our World in Data https://ourworldindata.org/latest

This email was sent to reader@example.com because you subscribed to email updates from Our World in Data.

You can update your preferences https://ourworldindata.org/api/email-notifications/request-link?token=user-token or unsubscribe https://ourworldindata.org/api/email-notifications/unsubscribe?token=user-token at any time.

Our World in Data · Global Change Data Lab · Oxford, United Kingdom"
`;
